---
import Shell from '../../layouts/Shell.astro';
import ResponsiveImage from '../../components/ResponsiveImage.astro';
import SaveJourney from '../../components/SaveJourney.astro';
import story from '../../../../../kb/research/stories/narratives/maritime-memory.json';
import regions from '../../../../../kb/research/destinations/regions.json';
const hero=regions.assets[story.hero], courtyard=regions.assets[story.visit.photo];
---
<Shell title={story.title} description={story.lead} active="explore" wide related={false}>
<article class="wrap maritime-story">
  <header class="maritime-hero">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">Odisha and the sea · A reading story</p><h1>Boita.<br/><em>A sea of connections.</em></h1><p class="lead">{story.lead}</p><a class="text-link" href="#remembered-voyages">Follow the story ↓</a></div>
    <figure><ResponsiveImage src={hero.src} width={hero.width} height={hero.height} alt={hero.alt} fetchpriority="high" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 92vw, 52vw"/><figcaption>{story.hero_caption}</figcaption></figure>
  </header>
  <section aria-label="Keep this reading story"><p>Keep this story for another day, with its questions and sources. Save it to My journey, then download a text or illustrated book. This saves the reading; the museum visit is a separate choice below.</p><SaveJourney id={story.save_id}/></section>
  <p class="opening-copy">{story.opening}</p>
  <nav class="story-nav" aria-label="Maritime story chapters">{story.chapters.map(c=><a href={'#'+c.id}>{c.eyebrow}</a>)}<a href="#visit-jobra">Bring it to a visit</a><a href="#story-sources">Sources &amp; reading notes</a></nav>
  {story.chapters.map(chapter=><section id={chapter.id} class="story-chapter">
    <div class="chapter-title"><p class="eyebrow">{chapter.eyebrow}</p><h2>{chapter.title}</h2></div>
    <div class="chapter-body">{chapter.paragraphs.map(p=><p>{p}</p>)}
      {chapter.id==='a-travelled-stone'&&<div class="stone-connection" role="group" aria-label="Anchor rock evidence, not a sailing route"><div><span>Probable rock source</span><strong>Palitana, Gujarat</strong></div><div><span>Anchor find</span><strong>Manikapatna, Odisha</strong></div><p>Connected by the study’s material analysis. No itinerary is reconstructed here.</p></div>}
      <aside class="looking-question"><h3>A question to carry</h3><p>{chapter.question}</p></aside>
    </div>
  </section>)}
  <section id="visit-jobra" class="visit-jobra">
    <figure><ResponsiveImage src={courtyard.src} width={courtyard.width} height={courtyard.height} alt={courtyard.alt} loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 92vw, 50vw"/><figcaption>{story.visit.caption}</figcaption></figure>
    <div><p class="eyebrow">Read, notice, remember</p><h2>{story.visit.title}</h2><p>{story.visit.intro}</p><ol>{story.visit.questions.map(q=><li>{q}</li>)}</ol><a class="text-link" href={story.visit.href}>Read the museum guide →</a><p class="save-explanation">Keep the museum as an idea for a future visit.</p><SaveJourney id={story.visit.save_id}/></div>
  </section>
  <section class="next-reading"><p class="eyebrow">Keep the conversation moving</p><h2>What could we learn across a shared sea?</h2><p>Let curiosity about the past lead to respectful conversations today. Global Connections explores documented city relationships and possibilities for future collaboration.</p><a class="utk-button" href="/global-connections/">Explore Global Connections →</a><p><a href="/contribute/?page=%2Fstories%2Fmaritime-memory%2F">Share a public source or suggest a correction</a>. GitHub submissions are public; leave out private family and contact details.</p></section>
  <details id="story-sources" class="utk-disclosure story-credits"><summary>Sources, photographs &amp; reading notes</summary><p>Source review: {story.reviewed_on}. {story.editorial_note}</p><ol>{story.sources.map(s=><li id={s.id}><a href={s.url}>{s.title}</a><p>{s.note}</p><p>Read alongside: {story.chapters.filter(c=>c.source_ids.includes(s.id)).map(c=>c.title).join("; ")}.</p></li>)}</ol><h2>Photographs</h2><ul>{[hero,courtyard].map((photo,index)=><li><a href={photo.source}>{index===0?'Boat-building display':'Museum courtyard'}</a> · {photo.creator} · <a href={photo.license_url}>{photo.license}</a>. {photo.changes}</li>)}</ul><p>The photographs document museum spaces in 2013. They do not show the Manikapatna anchor, a Boita Bandana ceremony or an ancient voyage. No current exhibition or access confirmation is implied.</p></details>
</article>
</Shell>
<style>
.maritime-story{padding-block:30px 60px}.maritime-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.2fr;gap:clamp(28px,5vw,84px);align-items:center;padding-block:25px 35px}.maritime-hero .lead{margin:24px 0}.maritime-hero h1{font-size:clamp(46px,5.3vw,86px);line-height:1.04}.maritime-story em{color:var(--earth)}.maritime-story figure{margin:0;min-width:0}.maritime-story figure :global(img){display:block;width:100%;height:auto;object-fit:contain}.maritime-story figcaption{font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px}.opening-copy{max-width:65ch;margin:30px auto 50px;font-size:clamp(20px,2vw,26px);line-height:1.7}.story-nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px 28px;padding:18px 0;border-block:1px solid var(--line)}.story-nav a{min-height:44px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;font-size:15px}.story-chapter{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.2fr;gap:clamp(28px,6vw,96px);padding-block:65px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);scroll-margin-top:28px}.chapter-title h2{font-size:clamp(32px,3.5vw,53px);line-height:1.16;max-width:18ch}.chapter-body{max-width:66ch}.chapter-body>p{font-size:18px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:20px}.looking-question{border-left:3px solid var(--earth);padding:4px 0 4px 24px;margin-top:28px}.looking-question h3{font-size:23px;margin-bottom:10px}.looking-question p{margin-bottom:0;line-height:1.75}.stone-connection{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;background:var(--sea);color:var(--paper);padding:26px;margin:25px 0}.stone-connection span{display:block;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:8px}.stone-connection strong{font-size:19px}.stone-connection p{grid-column:1/-1;font-size:14px;margin:0;line-height:1.65}.visit-jobra{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr 1fr;gap:clamp(28px,5vw,80px);align-items:start;padding-block:70px;scroll-margin-top:28px}.visit-jobra h2,.next-reading h2{font-size:clamp(32px,3.5vw,52px)}.visit-jobra li{margin-bottom:18px;line-height:1.7}.visit-jobra ol{padding-left:23px}.save-explanation{font-size:14px;margin:24px 0 0}.next-reading{max-width:75ch;padding:30px 0 50px}.next-reading>p:last-child{font-size:14px;margin-top:25px}.story-credits{font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;max-width:90ch;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.story-credits summary{padding:16px 0;min-height:44px;cursor:pointer}.story-credits li{margin-block:20px;scroll-margin-top:24px}.story-credits h2{font-size:24px}.story-credits ol,.story-credits ul{padding-left:23px}@media(max-width:900px){.maritime-hero,.story-chapter,.visit-jobra{grid-template-columns:1fr}.story-chapter{padding-block:40px}.chapter-title h2{max-width:25ch}.opening-copy{margin-block:20px 35px}.visit-jobra{padding-block:40px}.chapter-body{max-width:none}}@media(max-width:420px){.stone-connection{grid-template-columns:1fr}.story-nav{gap:4px 20px}}@media print{.story-nav{display:none}.story-chapter,.visit-jobra,.maritime-hero{display:block}.story-chapter{padding-block:20px}.looking-question,.stone-connection{break-inside:avoid}}
</style>
